OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering daytime showers easing this
OL,7,Fevening to leave a largely dry night
OL,8,Fwith clear spells. Turning chilly for
OL,9,Fmany with light winds and a few mist
OL,10,Fpatches possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA warm, dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith plenty of sunny spells and light
OL,14,Fwinds. Clouding over in the evening
OL,15,Fperhaps with some outbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
